# Unicode CLDR 47, cldr-json cldr-dates-full/main/sw/dateFields.json.  The
# second field counts with one surface in both plural categories ("Sekunde {0}
# iliyopita", "Sekunde {0} zilizopita"): sekunde is class 9/10 and invariant,
# so the noun carries no count and the count lives in the numeral alone.
sekunde
